<title>JAPAN: Japan Energy to sell land worth 28.8 bln yen.</title>
<headline>Japan Energy to sell land worth 28.8 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Energy Corp said on Tuesday it had decided to sell some of its land in Tokyo to its real estate subsidiary for about 28.8 billion yen.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it would make a profit of 25 billion yen from the sale, to take place at the end of March.</p>
